#HELPS
1 GHOSTGATE~
Ghostgate is the fortified gateway through the old Ghostfence to Red Mountain,
where Ordinators and Buoyant Armigers protect the pass from Blighted monsters.
The Towers of Dawn and Dusk rise beside the great Tribunal Temple and barracks
while the glowing barrier stretches across the ashen wastes.~
